958)\n\n* Tablero: «MIROVA confirmó» mira la misma pasada (±120 s) con D-9 (S175 decisión 7)\n\nLa columna MIROVA de la tabla dice «MIROVA publicó alerta térmica en esta pasada», pero\nenrichWithMirovaConfirmation aceptaba cualquier alerta del mismo sensor a ±60 min y las de\n0,05 MW o menos que el banner de MIROVA llama NONE (F2-204, V2-04). Ahora usa la vara del\nbanco: ±120 s (clase_mirova.VENTANA_S) y D-9 en VIIRS 375 (una mínima sobrevive sólo con\notra alerta mayor a ±120 s, como aplicar_regla_minimas).\n\nMedido con la función real en node (experiments/_s175_confirmo_pasada/medir_salida.txt):\nde 3.349 publicaciones desde 2026-03-01, 856 pierden la marca (756 VIIRS 375, 100 VIIRS 750,\n0 MODIS) y ninguna la gana; 0 records cambian de filtro de artefacto. index.html conserva\nsu número de líneas (guard de citas). diario y mosaico no llenan la marca.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* S175 #958: la prueba vigila el rescate de la minima y el umbral D-9 por conducta (VPR958-02)\n\nEl caso con la mayor a 1 min confirmaba por la mayor y el rescate nunca decidia: M4, M8 (62 marcas reales)\ny M10 (77) pasaban con la suite verde. Tres casos nuevos: rescate que decide, mayor de otra pasada que no\nrescata, 0,06 MW sola que confirma. Mutaciones del verificador: de 10 a 13 de 14 atrapadas por asercion.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* S175 #958: el tooltip negativo de MIROVA dice lo que la marca mide (VPR958-01)\n\nLa marca mira la misma pasada (±120 s) con D-9, y el tooltip decía «MIROVA no publicó nada en esta pasada», falso con una alerta de 0,05 MW o menos y con la misma pasada publicada en el gránulo vecino. Cambia la primera frase en la tabla y en la tarjeta; el archivo conserva sus 4.420 líneas. A45: tag pre-s175-confirmo-misma-pasada y el sí de Nicolás.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: vb4 <vb4@local>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","timestamp":"2026-11-08T16:06:49Z","author":{"name":"NMendoza","email":"65313566+MendozaVolcanic@users.noreply.github.com"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com"}},"repository":{"id":1201037143,"node_id":"R_kgDOR5ZfVw","name":"VRP-chile","full_name":"MendozaVolcanic/VRP-chile","private":false,"owner":{"login":"MendozaVolcanic","id":65313566,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1MzEzNTY2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65313566?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MendozaVolcanic","html_url":"https://github.com/MendozaVolcanic","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MendozaVolcanic/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MendozaVolcanic/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MendozaVolcanic/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MendozaVolcanic/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MendozaVolcanic/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MendozaVolcanic/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MendozaVolcanic/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MendozaVolcanic/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MendozaVolcanic/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"html_url":"https://github.com/MendozaVolcanic/VRP-chile","description":"Near-Real-Time Volcanic Radiative Power monitoring for Chilean volcanoes using MODIS and VIIRS","fork":false,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MendozaVolcanic/VRP-chile","forks_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MendozaVolcanic/VRP-chile/forks","keys_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MendozaVolcanic/VRP-chile/keys{/key_id}","collaborators_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MendozaVolcanic/VRP-chile/collaborators{/collaborator}","teams_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MendozaVolcanic/VRP-chile/teams","hooks_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MendozaVolcanic/VRP-chi